---
type: event
name: core_edit_review
description: Prompt a core-tool review after a request to change AE's own harness behavior.
version: 1.0.0
enabled: false
target_agent: "*"
input_prompt: The user requested a change to AE's core harness. Inspect the relevant core AEX definition and existing tests, identify compatibility and regression risks, then implement and verify the requested change.
trigger:
  on:
    - type: message
      match: "change AE core"
---
